n requested\n1106:   - Simplified visual feedback\n1107: - [ ] Add high contrast mode\n1108:   - Toggle for high contrast colors\n1109:   - Larger text option\n1110:   - Improved readability\n1111: - [ ] Ensure minimum touch targets\n1112:   - 44×44px minimum for mobile\n1113:   - Spacious clickable areas\n1114: - [ ] Focus management\n1115:   - Visible focus indicators\n1116:   - Logical tab order\n1117:   - Focus trap in modals\n1118: \n1119: **Dependencies**: UI components, user interaction\n1120: \n1121: ### 6.3 Performance Optimization (LOW - Performance)\n1122: \n1123: - [ ] Implement performance monitoring\n1124:   - FPS counter (development only)\n1125:   - Memory usage tracking\n1126:   - Component render profiling\n1127: - [ ] Add performance optimizations\n1128:   - Memoize expensive calculations\n1129:   - Virtualize large lists (if applicable)\n1130:   - Lazy load non-critical components\n1131:   - Debounce/throttle frequent operations\n1132: - [ ] Profile and optimize\n1133:   - Identify performance bottlenecks\n1134:   - Optimize critical paths\n1135:   - Ensure 60fps with 500+ cells\n1136:   - Test on low-end devices\n1137: - [ ] Implement lazy loading\n1138:   - Load audio on first interaction\n1139:   - Lazy load expert settings panel\n1140:   - Code splitting for production\n1141: \n1142: **Dependencies**: All systems\n1143: \n1144: ### 6.4 Testing (LOW - Quality Assurance)\n1145: \n1146: - [ ] Set up testing framework\n1147:   - Choose testing framework (Vitest recommended)\n1148:   - Configure test environment\n1149:   - Set up coverage reporting\n1150: - [ ] Write unit tests for simulation engine\n1151:   - Rule application (born/survive)\n1152:   - Toroidal boundaries\n1153:   - Age tracking\n1154:   - Edge cases (empty grid, static patterns)\n1155: - [ ] Write unit tests for phase management\n1156:   - Phase transitions\n1157:   - Guard conditions\n1158:   - Timer accuracy\n1159: - [ ] Write unit tests for flux management\n1160:   - Placement