ha = easeProgress` (line 121)\n  \n- **Shrink animation (death)**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/CanvasGrid.tsx` lines 141-169\n  - Scales from 1 to 0: `const scale = 1 - easeProgress` (line 149)\n  - Fades out with globalAlpha: `ctx.globalAlpha = 1 - easeProgress` (line 153)\n  \n- **Red flash animation**: **NOT IMPLEMENTED**\n  - Only a red border stroke for invalid actions (lines 171-185)\n  - No full red flash fill animation\n\n## 2. Scoring system UI - Pattern breakdown UI\n**Status: FULLY IMPLEMENTED**\n\n- **ScoreDisplay.tsx**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/ScoreDisplay.tsx`\n  - Props for movers, oscillators, rate (lines 8-10)\n  - Pattern breakdown UI (lines 111-126) displays:\n    - Movers count (lines 114-115)\n    - Oscillators count (lines 118-119)\n    - Rate per generation (lines 122-123)\n  \n- **Game.tsx**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx` lines 334-338\n  - Passes `showPatternBreakdown={true}` to enable the breakdown\n  - Calculates movers/oscillators from tracked clusters (lines 321-325)\n\n## 3. End-of-level stats\n**Status: PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED**\n\n- **VictoryScreen.tsx**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/VictoryScreen.tsx`\n  - Shows total score only (lines 5, 26, 37)\n  \n- **Missing**: Time survived, patterns created, detailed stats\n\n## 4. High score persistence\n**Status: FULLY IMPLEMENTED**\n\n- **level.ts**: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/level.ts`\n  - `saveHighScore()` function (lines 150-158) - saves per level\n  - `getHighScore()` function (lines 160-163) - loads per level\n  - `loadHighScores()` helper (lines 130-140) - loads from localStorage\n  - `saveHighScores()` helper (lines 142-148) - saves to localStorage\n  - Storage key: `'gol-high-scores'` (line 3)\n  \n- **Game.tsx** uses these: lines 101, 186-189\n\n## 5. Touch ripple effect\n**Status: NOT IMPLEMENTED**\n\n- No ripple effects found in any CSS files\n- Mentioned as