{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1771201001234,"sessionID":"ses_39c3416c0ffeUYCFcwGrAdjGPB","part":{"id":"prt_c63ce7710001cbkjaxir5PubUq","sessionID":"ses_39c3416c0ffeUYCFcwGrAdjGPB","messageID":"msg_c63ce6988001SOCUY1SfLAGELT","type":"step-start","snapshot":"9f0ab83952a7bf23b7b48709d52ea08a1f2a5155"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771201059335,"sessionID":"ses_39c3416c0ffeUYCFcwGrAdjGPB","part":{"id":"prt_c63ce7c55001M9jgoXMSSkeoJS","sessionID":"ses_39c3416c0ffeUYCFcwGrAdjGPB","messageID":"msg_c63ce6988001SOCUY1SfLAGELT","type":"tool","callID":"call_1abf761020b947719d1f08bd","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Analyze available stats data","prompt":"Analyze Game.tsx to identify what statistics data is available for end-of-level stats display. Specifically look for:\n\n1. Score data (currentScore, finalScore per level)\n2. Time data (timeLimitSeconds, timeRemaining)\n3. Pattern data (trackedClusters, totalPatternsTracked)\n4. Generation data (generation count)\n5. Any other relevant metrics\n\nAlso check what data is passed to VictoryScreen and TransitionOverlay.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39c3183a6ffeXCuRh21HZTGBSj (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nBased on my analysis of Game.tsx and related files, here's a comprehensive overview of the statistics data available for end-of-level stats display:\n\n## 1. Score Data\n\n**Available in Game.tsx:**\n- `scoreState.currentScore` - Current level score (line 47, 332)\n- `scoreState.generationScore` - Score from the last generation (from ScoreState type, line 57)\n- `scoreState.totalPatternsTracked` - Total patterns tracked in ScoreState type (line 58)\n- `previousScore` - Score before the last update (line 150, 215, 333)\n- `levelProgression.totalScore` - Cumulative score across all levels (line 64, 115, 359)\n- `highScore` - High score for current level (line 61, 101, 188, 338)\n\n**Final Score Per Level:**\n- Saved when phase is FINISHED: `scoreState.currentScore` (line 186)\n- Passed to next level via `advanceLevel(levelProgression, scoreState.currentScore)` (line 125)\n\n**VictoryScreen receives:**\n- `totalScore` - cumulative total score across all completed levels (line 359)\n\n## 2. Time Data\n\n**Available in Game.tsx:**\n- `currentLevelConfig.timeLimitSeconds` - Time limit for the current level (line 96, 250)\n- `phaseState.timerRemaining` - Remaining time in seconds (line 385)\n- Phase duration config in `useTransition`:\n  - `fadeOutDuration: 2000` ms (line 140)\n  - `fadeInDuration: 2000` ms (line 141)\n  - `interstitialDuration: 2000` ms (line 142)\n\n## 3. Pattern Data\n\n**Available in Game.tsx:**\n- `trackedClusters` - Array of TrackedCluster objects (line 62, 217)\n  - Each cluster contains: `id`, `cells`, `centroid`, `centroidHistory`, `velocity`, `classification`, `generation`\n- `movers` - Count of MOVER classified clusters (line 321, 335)\n- `oscillators` - Count of OSCILLATOR classified clusters (line 322, 336)\n- `rate` - Current scoring rate calculation (lines 323-325, 337):\n  ```typescript\n  rate = scoringConfig.moverPointsPerGeneration * movers +\n         scoringConfig.oscillatorPointsPerGeneration * oscillators\n  ```\n- `previousTrackedClustersRef.current` - Previous frame's tracked clusters (line 64, 216)\n\n**From ScoreState:**\n- `totalPatternsTracked` - Total number of patterns tracked (type definition line 58)\n\n**Classification types:**\n- 'MOVER' - Moving patterns\n- 'OSCILLATOR' - Oscillating patterns\n- 'STATIC' - Static patterns (lines 19, 244)\n\n## 4. Generation Data\n\n**Available in Game.tsx:**\n- `generation` - Current generation number (line 46, 320, 383)\n- Updated each simulation step: `setGeneration(result.newGeneration)` (line 220)\n- Passed to `GlassHUD` for display (line 383)\n\n## 5. Other Relevant Metrics\n\n**Cell Count Data:**\n- `aliveCount` - Number of alive cells on grid (line 292, 377)\n- Computed from `grid.flat().filter((cell) => cell > 0).length`\n\n**Flux Data:**\n- `flux.current` - Current flux (line 378)\n- `flux.initial` - Initial flux (line 379)\n- `flux.placed` - Cells placed (from FluxState type)\n- `flux.removed` - Cells removed (from FluxState type)\n\n**Level Progression Data:**\n- `levelProgression.currentLevel` - Current level number (line 62, 349, 354)\n- `levelProgression.maxUnlockedLevel` - Highest unlocked level (line 63)\n- `levelProgression.levels` - Array of LevelConfig objects (line 65)\n- `currentLevelConfig` - Current level configuration (line 96):\n  - `levelNumber`\n  - `timeLimitSeconds`\n  - `initialFlux`\n\n**Phase State:**\n- `phaseState.current` - Current game phase: 'PLANNING' | 'COUNTDOWN' | 'RUNNING' | 'FINISHED' (line 376, 384)\n- `phaseState.countdownValue` - Countdown value (line 384)\n\n**TransitionOverlay receives:**\n- `transitionState` - 'PLAYING' | 'FADING_OUT' | 'INTERSTITIAL' | 'FADING_IN' | 'READY' (line 353)\n- `currentLevel` - Current level number (line 354)\n\n## Summary of What's Currently Passed to Stats Displays\n\n**VictoryScreen (line 357-371):**\n- Only receives `totalScore` (cumulative across all levels)\n- Missing: per-level stats, patterns, time, generations\n\n**TransitionOverlay (line 352-355):**\n- Receives `transitionState` and `currentLevel`\n- No statistics data - only shows level complete text\n\n**GlassHUD (line 375-397):**\n- Shows live stats during gameplay:\n  - `generation` - Current generation\n  - `aliveCount` - Live cell count\n  - `flux` - Current and max flux\n  - `timerRemaining` - Time remaining\n  - `phase` - Current phase\n  - `countdownValue` - Countdown\n\n**ScoreDisplay (line 331-339):**\n- Shows score breakdown:\n  - `score` - Current score\n  - `previousScore` - Previous score\n  - `movers` - Mover count\n  - `oscillators` - Oscillator count\n  - `rate` - Current scoring rate\n  - `highScore` - High score\n\n## Recommendations for Enhanced Stats Display\n\nTo create a comprehensive end-of-level stats display, you could pass the following data to either VictoryScreen or a new StatsModal component:\n\n```typescript\n{\n  // Score metrics\n  finalScore: number,\n  highScore: number,\n  generationScore: number,\n  \n  // Time metrics\n  timeLimitSeconds: number,\n  timeRemaining: number,\n  \n  // Pattern metrics\n  